          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c1118a0ac90b57604e7d1c6b37e4fa69c64b6d52256052c3e4720015c89c8224:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_940cb062dabe4dc5a15a0bda3b341951",
      "statement": "The fetch promise is registered in `pending` before fetchFn is invoked (via Promise.resolve().then(fetchFn)), so a fetcher that throws synchronously still deduplicates — concurrent callers share one rejection — and because settlement clears the pending slot, a later call retries rather than reusing the failure.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/__tests__/stores/CacheManager.test.ts#L231-L255",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:027a2e7d2c0b1df847e3f8d200ea30efd0c3f589655766c4c201f11c30dd0997:"
        },
        {
