    {
      "id": "claim_bc3a398d069540dab1bab313e9265874",
      "statement": "Invalidation during flight (delete, clear, or invalidatePattern) detaches pending work: the original callers still receive the detached promise's outcome, but a post-settlement identity guard (pending.get(key) === promise) fails, so the late value can never repopulate the cache.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/__tests__/stores/CacheManager.test.ts#L279-L298",
