      "id": "claim_99619b77438742e8bba3caa35ed5cdd0",
      "statement": "A getOrFetch started after invalidation launches a fresh fetch that owns the pending slot; the old request's settlement — whether it resolves or rejects — can neither overwrite the fresh result nor detach the fresh pending entry, so callers arriving after the old one settles still deduplicate onto the replacement.",
