      "statement": "Expiry is inclusive (dead at Date.now() >= expiresAt, so a zero-TTL value is never retained) and lazy — paid on read — supplemented by a counter-driven sweep every 50th read/write that evicts unread expired entries; pending promises are never swept, only invalidated or settled.",
